                <pb facs="0467" n="379" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg379"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/3446: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Chairman of the American Delegation</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hull</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-12-19T20:00:00-05:00">December 19, 1933—8
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>102. Your 71, December 19, 2 p.m. Warm congratulations. This is a great
                    achievement.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
